ENTITY V6
QUALIFY V6 type tau_V

ENTITY V7
QUALIFY V7 type tau_V

ENTITY CX1C
QUALIFY CX1C kind context
QUALIFY CX1C type tau_CX
QUALIFY CX1C base_type tau_V
QUALIFY CX1C distinguishes_type tau_V
QUALIFY CX1C member V1
QUALIFY CX1C member V2
QUALIFY CX1C member V3
QUALIFY CX1C member V4
QUALIFY CX1C member V5
QUALIFY CX1C member V6
QUALIFY CX1C member V7

ENTITY RVup
QUALIFY RVup kind relation
QUALIFY RVup type tau_R
RTYPE RVup tau_V tau_V
QUALIFY RVup functional true

EDGE V1 RVup V2 1

EDGE V2 RVup V3 1

EDGE V3 RVup V4 1

EDGE V4 RVup V5 1

EDGE V5 RVup V6 1

EDGE V6 RVup V7 1

EDGE V7 RVup V1 1

ENTITY U1_2
QUALIFY U1_2 kind stream
QUALIFY U1_2 type Stream(tau_V)
AT U1_2 I0 V6
AT U1_2 I1 V7
AT U1_2 I2 V1

ENTITY T1_2
QUALIFY T1_2 kind task
QUALIFY T1_2 context CX1C
QUALIFY T1_2 input U1_2
QUALIFY T1_2 available_relation R0
QUALIFY T1_2 available_relation R1
QUALIFY T1_2 available_relation R2
QUALIFY T1_2 available_relation RVup

UNKNOWN_AT T1_2 X1_2 U1_2 I3 tau_V

CONSTRAINT SAME_RELATION_SUCCESSIVE C1_2 U1_2
QUALIFY T1_2 constraint C1_2
